{"type":"message","id":"234dcb19","parentId":"96edf744","timestamp":"2026-04-24T11:22:28.362Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b518169cfdec8c3f788ac5abe8f5\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-24 19:22 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b518169cfdec8c3f788ac5abe8f5]\nou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77: 我设定好了你的名字，是保存在了哪里"}],"timestamp":1777029748361}}
{"type":"message","id":"4e60c8ee","parentId":"234dcb19","timestamp":"2026-04-24T11:22:33.330Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 目前还**没有真正落盘保存**。\n\n你刚才把我的名字设成了“钳多多”，我是在这段对话里记住并用了它，但按工作区设计，应该保存到：\n\n- `IDENTITY.md`，记录我的名字\n- 也可以顺手在 `memory/2026-04-24.md` 或 `MEMORY.md` 里记一笔这次初始化信息\n\n也就是说，**现在它大概率还只存在于当前会话上下文里**，还没正式写进 workspace 文件。\n\n如果你要，我现在就可以帮你把：\n- `IDENTITY.md` 写上名字“钳多多”\n- `USER.md` 写上我对你的称呼“塘主”\n- 然后删掉 `BOOTSTRAP.md`，把初始化收尾\n\n我建议直接做，不然下次新会话未必还稳稳记得。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb52756dec8191b4742f37da363997\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":402,"output":209,"cacheRead":31360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31971,"cost":{"input":0.001005,"output":0.003135,"cacheRead":0.00784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011980000000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777029748362,"responseId":"resp_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb5274ce248191bdea77e201a02202"}}
