m/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:159:- Default: tools run on the host for the `main` session, so the agent has full access when it is just you.\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:160:- Group/channel safety: set `agents.defaults.sandbox.mode: \"non-main\"` to run non-`main` sessions inside per-session Docker sandboxes.\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:161:- Typical sandbox default: allow `bash`, `process`, `read`, `write`, `edit`, `sessions_list`, `sessions_history`, `sessions_send`, `sessions_spawn`; deny `browser`, `canvas`, `nodes`, `cron`, `discord`, `gateway`.\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:162:- Before exposing anything remotely, read [Security](https://docs.openclaw.ai/gateway/security), [Docker sandboxing](https://docs.openclaw.ai/install/docker), and [Configuration](https://docs.openclaw.ai/gateway/configuration).\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:167:- Session tools: `sessions_list`, `sessions_history`, `sessions_send`\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:176:- Config + security: [Configuration](https://docs.openclaw.ai/gateway/configuration), [Security](https://docs.openclaw.ai/gateway/security), [Docker sandboxing](https://docs.openclaw.ai/install/docker)\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:178:- Tools + automation: [Tools](https://docs.openclaw.ai/tools), [Skills](https://docs.openclaw.ai/tools/skills), [Cron jobs](https://docs.openclaw.ai/automation/cron-jobs), [Webhooks](https://docs.openclaw.ai/automation/webhook), [Gmail Pub/Sub](https://docs.openclaw.ai/automation/gmail-pubsub)\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:179:- Internals: [Architecture](https://docs.openclaw.ai/concepts/architecture), [Agent](https://docs.openclaw.ai/concepts/agent), [Session model](https://docs.openclaw.ai/concepts/session), [Gateway protocol](https://docs.openclaw.ai/reference/rpc)\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:192:- WebChat + debug tools.\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:242:- Workspace root: `~/.openclaw/workspace` (configurable via `agents.defaults.workspace`).\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:243:- Injected prompt files: `AGENTS.md`, `SOUL.md`, `TOOLS.md`.\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:248:Minimal `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` (model + defaults):\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/README.md:253:    model: \"<provider>/<model-id>\",\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/templates/TOOLS.md:10:Skills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/templates/USER.md:3:summary: \"User profile record\"\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/templates/BOOTSTRAP.md:3:summary: \"First-run ritual for new agents\"\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/templates/AGENTS.md:130:Skills provide your tools. When you need one, check its `SKILL.md`. Keep local notes (camera names, SSH details, voice preferences) in `TOOLS.md`.\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/templates/AGENTS.md:142:When you receive a heartbeat poll (message matches the configured heartbeat prompt), don't just reply `HEARTBEAT_OK` every time. Use heartbeats productively!\n/Users/chandor/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.2/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/reference/templates/AGENTS.md:159:- You want a differ