{"type":"message","id":"fa239bec","parentId":"0dd4fea6","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:20:50.674Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5182ac279ca4c4d8ee737ef8acd\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-24 21:20 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5182ac279ca4c4d8ee737ef8acd]\nou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77: 1"}],"timestamp":1777036850673}}
{"type":"message","id":"1fdc0d45","parentId":"fa239bec","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:21:04.479Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好，我给你一个**最小可用的多 agent 配置示例**。\n\n你现在的配置是“只有 `agents.defaults`”。  \n如果要新增第二个 agent，思路是：\n\n- 保留 `agents.defaults` 当公共默认值\n- 再新增一个命名 agent，例如 `writer`\n- 然后按路由规则，把某些会话或渠道分配给它\n\n一个**示意配置**可以长这样（这是示例，不是我确认过你当前版本唯一正确写法）：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"defaults\": {\n      \"workspace\": \"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspace\",\n      \"models\": {\n        \"openai-codex/gpt-5.4\": {}\n      },\n      \"model\": {\n        \"primary\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.4\"\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"writer\": {\n      \"workspace\": \"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspaces/writer\",\n      \"model\": {\n        \"primary\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.4\"\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"ops\": {\n      \"workspace\": \"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspaces/ops\",\n      \"model\": {\n        \"primary\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.4\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**这段的意思**\n- `defaults`\n  - 所有 agent 的公共默认配置\n- `writer`\n  - 一个专门写作的 agent\n  - 用独立 workspace，能有自己的 `AGENTS.md`、`SOUL.md`、记忆\n- `ops`\n  - 一个专门运维/排障的 agent\n  - 也可以有单独工作区\n\n**为什么要独立 workspace**\n因为这样每个 agent 可以有不同的：\n- 人格\n- 提示词\n- 工具笔记\n- 记忆\n- 项目文件\n\n也就是说：\n- `main` 像总助理\n- `writer` 像文案助手\n- `ops` 像运维助手\n\n**下一步真正要解决的是“怎么路由到它”**\n光定义 agent 还不够，你还要决定：\n- 哪个渠道走哪个 agent\n- 哪个用户/群聊走哪个 agent\n- 还是手动在会话里指定 agent\n\n这部分通常要看 OpenClaw 当前版本的 **gateway/configuration** 文档具体支持什么字段。\n\n**我建议你下一步这样做**\n我可以继续替你查两件关键事：\n1. 当前版本里，**命名 agent 的准确配置格式**\n2. **如何把 Feishu 对话路由到指定 agent**\n\n如果你点头，我就继续往下查，不空讲。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb6e3540788191bd77e673b2fa9cf1\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":415,"output":614,"cacheRead":38144,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39173,"cost":{"input":0.0010375,"output":0.00921,"cacheRead":0.009536,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0197835}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777036850674,"responseId":"resp_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb6e333c248191a2ab0a8d80c62d30"}}
