{"type":"message","id":"fb27ea7b","parentId":"1dcf31bc","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:30:30.656Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Ify1zWNtTN3UuyesrNmcpbZW|fc_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb706f71508191b1026cae5e5ef32d","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenClaw status\n\nOverview\n┌──────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Item                 │ Value                                                                                         │\n├──────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ OS                   │ macos 26.4.1 (arm64) · node 22.22.2                                                           │\n│ Dashboard            │ http://127.0.0.1:18789/                                                                       │\n│ Tailscale            │ off                                                                                           │\n│ Channel              │ stable (default)                                                                              │\n│ Update               │ available · pnpm · npm update 2026.4.22                                                       │\n│ Gateway              │ local · ws://127.0.0.1:18789 (local loopback) · reachable 37ms · auth token · ChandordeMac-   │\n│                      │ mini.local (100.82.185.157) app 2026.4.15 macos 26.4.1                                        │\n│ Gateway self         │ ChandordeMac-mini.local (100.82.185.157) app 2026.4.15 macos 26.4.1                           │\n│ Gateway service      │ LaunchAgent installed · loaded · running (pid 5421, state active)                             │\n│ Node service         │ LaunchAgent not installed                                                                     │\n│ Agents               │ 1 · 1 bootstrap file present · sessions 2 · default main active 1m ago             