{"type":"message","id":"6ed79d71","parentId":"c3bfc381","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:47:01.331Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b51830bdf70b0c45e766cd98d1aa\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-24 21:46 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b51830bdf70b0c45e766cd98d1aa]\nou_7d59aa4c5bd4a549a71cd8cda4ecde77: 那你是否可以按照这套体系架构，在自己的工作空间中完全对照实现一套"}],"timestamp":1777038421330}}
{"type":"message","id":"aa13ddd3","parentId":"6ed79d71","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:47:14.520Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以。\n\n而且这事我能直接做，不只是口头模仿，而是把它**按 OpenClaw 的工作方式**在我的 workspace 里落成一套可用结构。\n\n我能给你实现的内容大致包括：\n\n- 一个专门的项目目录\n- 对应的主控说明文件\n- 改编方法论文件\n- 输出风格文件\n- 模板文件\n- 示例文件\n- 两个质量检查子角色的说明文件\n- 一套适配我当前环境的工作流程\n\n不过我先说清一件事：\n\n**我不能“原封不动复制”对方项目的整套内容当成自己的成品交付**，尤其是如果那是别人的完整作品结构和文本。  \n但我**可以严格参考其体系、功能分层、工作流设计和方法论逻辑，做一套等价可用、在我这里真正跑得通的版本**。\n\n也就是说，我可以做的是：\n\n- **保留架构思想**\n  - 主控层\n  - skill 知识层\n  - 质量校验层\n  - 项目文档层\n\n- **重写为 OpenClaw 版**\n  - 适配我的 workspace\n  - 适配当前工具链\n  - 适配当前会话/子代理能力\n  - 适配你之后实际使用的方式\n\n我建议做成下面这种结构：\n\n```text\nworkspace/\n└── webtoon-adapter/\n    ├── AGENTS.md\n    ├── project-template/\n    │   ├── novel/\n    │   ├── plot-breakdown.md\n    │   └── scripts/\n    ├── skills/\n    │   └── webtoon-adaptation/\n    │       ├── SKILL.md\n    │       ├── adapt-method.md\n    │       ├── output-style.md\n    │       ├── templates/\n    │       └── examples/\n    └── agents/\n        ├── breakdown-aligner.md\n        └── webtoon-aligner.md\n```\n\n这样做的好处是：\n- 不污染我当前主 workspace 的人格文件\n- 以后你要拿来直接开项目也方便\n- 我可以把它整理成一个长期可维护的“网文改编漫剧系统”\n\n**结论**\n- 可以做\n- 我建议做\n- 而且应该做成“参考原体系，但适配 OpenClaw 的可运行版本”\n\n如果你一句话确认：\n**“开始搭建”**\n\n我就直接在 workspace 里给你建出来。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb7457f420819189cf78732d236dfa\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":15923,"output":579,"cacheRead":68096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84598,"cost":{"input":0.0398075,"output":0.008685,"cacheRead":0.017024,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0655165}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777038421331,"responseId":"resp_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb7455fe0c8191bb61e60db4e1e263"}}
