{"type":"message","id":"62295d8d","parentId":"9339b582","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:50:10.318Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_kW3TvrUNI1V2U090ThhCXjtZ|fc_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb7512386c8191bfd6b8d503cbd69e","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspace/webtoon-adapter/AGENTS.md","content":"# AGENTS.md - Webtoon Adapter Workspace\n\nYou are a senior web-novel-to-webtoon drama adapter working in this project workspace.\n\n## Mission\nConvert serialized web novels into fast-paced Chinese manhua/drama scripts.\nPreserve the source story spine, but prioritize emotional hooks, conflict density, visual readability, episode cliffhangers, and adaptation usability.\n\n## Core workflow\n1. Determine novel type and adaptation positioning.\n2. Break down source chapters in 6-chapter batches.\n3. Label plot points by episode and usage state.\n4. Draft episode scripts from unused plot points.\n5. Run quality checks before finalizing output.\n\n## Writing principles\n- Adapt, do not translate.\n- Prefer visual beats over literary narration.\n- Compress setup, preserve payoff.\n- Keep Chinese output concise, punchy, and stageable.\n- End every episode on a real hook.\n\n## Project files\n- `project-template/novel/`: source chapter txt files\n- `project-template/plot-breakdown.md`: plot breakdown and episode mapping\n- `project-template/scripts/`: per-episode scripts\n- `skills/webtoon-adaptation/`: adaptation knowledge pack\n- `agents/`: quality check role specs\n\n## Quality control\n- Use `agents/breakdown-aligner.md` as the checklist for plot-breakdown review.\n- Use `agents/webtoon-aligner.md` as the checklist for episode script review.\n- Do not finalize output when obvious continuity, pacing, or format issues remain.\n"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspace/webtoon-adapter/AGENTS.md\",\"content\":\"# AGENTS.md - Webtoon Adapter Workspace\\n\\nYou are a senior web-novel-to-webtoon drama adapter working in this project workspace.\\n\\n## Mission\\nConvert serialized web novels into fast-paced Chinese manhua/drama scripts.\\nPreserve the source story spine, but prioritize emotional hooks, conflict density, visual readability, episode cliffhangers, and adaptation usability.\\n\\n## Core workflow\\n1. Determine novel type and adaptation positioning.\\n2. Break down source chapters in 6-chapter batches.\\n3. Label plot points by episode and usage state.\\n4. Draft episode scripts from unused plot points.\\n5. Run quality checks before finalizing output.\\n\\n## Writing principles\\n- Adapt, do not translate.\\n- Prefer visual beats over literary narration.\\n- Compress setup, preserve payoff.\\n- Keep Chinese output concise, punchy, and stageable.\\n- End every episode on a real hook.\\n\\n## Project files\\n- `project-template/novel/`: source chapter txt files\\n- `project-template/plot-breakdown.md`: plot breakdown and episode mapping\\n- `project-template/scripts/`: per-episode scripts\\n- `skills/webtoon-adaptation/`: adaptation knowledge pack\\n- `agents/`: quality check role specs\\n\\n## Quality control\\n- Use `agents/breakdown-aligner.md` as the checklist for plot-breakdown review.\\n- Use `agents/webtoon-aligner.md` as the checklist for episode script review.\\n- Do not finalize output when obvious continuity, pacing, or format issues remain.\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dW1uIBMJ3KSPEW6Dr1Y68WWE|fc_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb7512388081918a3a7ab30fbadff4","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspace/webtoon-adapter/project-template/plot-breakdown.md","content":"# 小说名称：\n# 小说类型：\n\n## 项目说明\n- 剧情拆解按 6 章一批进行\n- 剧情点格式统一为【剧情n】\n- 默认状态：未用\n- 剧本创作后，将已使用剧情点更新为已用\n\n## 剧情列表\n\n"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspace/webtoon-adapter/project-template/plot-breakdown.md\",\"content\":\"# 小说名称：\\n# 小说类型：\\n\\n## 项目说明\\n- 剧情拆解按 6 章一批进行\\n- 剧情点格式统一为【剧情n】\\n- 默认状态：未用\\n- 剧本创作后，将已使用剧情点更新为已用\\n\\n## 剧情列表\\n\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rglUlXVmnoAHI5wPJceia3hx|fc_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb751238888191af0f58d5bc3325cc","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspace/webtoon-adapter/project-template/scripts/.gitkeep","content":""},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspace/webtoon-adapter/project-template/scripts/.gitkeep\",\"content\":\"\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_kXKgQnH0AFQfAlFH6Gwk5bbB|fc_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb7512388c8191827049d210f560e2","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspace/webtoon-adapter/project-template/novel/.gitkeep","content":""},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspace/webtoon-adapter/project-template/novel/.gitkeep\",\"content\":\"\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":130,"output":572,"cacheRead":89088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89790,"cost":{"input":0.00032500000000000004,"output":0.00858,"cacheRead":0.022272,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.031177000000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777038598226,"responseId":"resp_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb7506d6288191bdf94f3fc369e00d"}}
