{"type":"message","id":"92184779","parentId":"0a7b64a0","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:51:41.526Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 搭好了。\n\n我已经在 workspace 里落了一套 **OpenClaw 版网文改编漫剧工作架构**，并且已经提交到 git。\n\n**位置**\n- `/Users/chandor/.openclaw/workspace/webtoon-adapter`\n\n**已完成内容**\n- `webtoon-adapter/AGENTS.md`\n  - 这个子工作区的主规则和工作流\n- `webtoon-adapter/project-template/plot-breakdown.md`\n  - 项目拆解主文档模板\n- `webtoon-adapter/skills/webtoon-adaptation/SKILL.md`\n  - 核心 skill 入口\n- `webtoon-adapter/skills/webtoon-adaptation/references/adapt-method.md`\n  - 改编方法论\n- `webtoon-adapter/skills/webtoon-adaptation/references/output-style.md`\n  - 输出风格规范\n- `webtoon-adapter/skills/webtoon-adaptation/assets/templates/`\n  - 拆解模板、剧本模板\n- `webtoon-adapter/skills/webtoon-adaptation/assets/examples/`\n  - 示例拆解、示例剧本\n- `webtoon-adapter/agents/breakdown-aligner.md`\n  - 拆解质检规则\n- `webtoon-adapter/agents/webtoon-aligner.md`\n  - 剧本一致性质检规则\n\n**git 提交**\n- commit: `0d877c3`\n- message: `Add webtoon adaptation workspace scaffold`\n\n**说明**\n这不是对原项目的机械复制，而是我按它的体系逻辑，重构成了一个更适合我当前 OpenClaw 工作空间使用的版本。核心架构、职责分层、改编方法和质检思路已经在了。\n\n**下一步我建议做两件事之一**\n1. 我继续把它**补成可直接开工的完整项目模板**\n   - 加 `README` 风格的操作入口\n   - 加 `/status`、`/breakdown`、`/script` 的实际使用说明\n   - 补项目初始化文案\n\n2. 你直接给我一部小说，我用这套架构**实战跑第一轮**\n   - 先定类型\n   - 再做前 6 章拆解\n\n如果你要，我下一步就继续把这套系统补到“可直接使用”的程度。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb7563ec008191ad082d51b2028b23\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":171,"output":523,"cacheRead":94336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95030,"cost":{"input":0.00042750000000000004,"output":0.007845,"cacheRead":0.023583999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.031856499999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777038688492,"responseId":"resp_0c6336fc39e190e40169eb7561210c8191b0817d7bef6cbd7b"}}
